  "safe_join": "Frozen case_id + checkpoint P4 + event_seq + method + placement + head, enforce one row per case and exclude duplicate placements; join annotations by frozen case_id after independent annotation. DeepSeek uses same case_id, P4, event_seq. Never join P7 or proposal bound by episode ID.",
